<para>Flush any buffered or in-flight spans to the exporter.</para>
<para>Calls ForceFlush() on the underlying SDK TracerProvider so that all spans queued in the processor&apos;s internal buffer are exported before the call returns (subject to <computeroutput>timeout</computeroutput>). When THEMIS_ENABLE_TRACING is not defined this is a no-op and always returns true.</para>
