<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_tracer" kindref="compound">Tracer</ref> wrapper for OpenTelemetry distributed tracing</para>
<para>Provides a simple interface for creating spans and managing trace context. When THEMIS_ENABLE_TRACING is not defined, this becomes a no-op wrapper.</para>
<para>Usage: auto span = <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_tracer_1af9dfa23a0e4d1156e0996bb0dee1a3d8" kindref="member">Tracer::startSpan</ref>(&quot;handleAqlQuery&quot;); span.setAttribute(&quot;query.table&quot;, &quot;users&quot;); // ... work happens ... span.end(); // or rely on RAII destructor </para>
